---

<section class="lobby" id="lobby" data-floor="G" aria-labelledby="lobby-h">
  <div class="wrap lobby-grid">
    <div class="lobby-head">
      <p class="floorlabel"><b>G</b>The lobby<span class="line"></span></p>
      <h2 id="lobby-h">Three floors up, <em>opposite Chaugan.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">
        If you know the ground, you know the way. The lift runs, and the stairs are there if you'd rather walk.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <span class="n">1</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Face Chaugan Ground</h3>
          <p>Stand on the Naya Bazar side of the ground.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n">2</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Walk into Hotel City Heart</h3>
          <p>The hotel sits right opposite the ground.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n">3</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Take the lift to 3</h3>
          <p>The doors open onto Zaika. Ask for a window table.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <div class="hours">
      <div class="now">
        <p class="micro">Right now</p>
        <p class="big">
          <span class="dot on" data-status-dot style="display:inline-block;margin-right:16px;vertical-align:8px"></span>
          <span data-status-short>Open now</span>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted)" data-status-text>
          Day sitting until 4 pm. The night sitting starts at 6.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="micro">Day sitting</p>
        <p class="big">8:15 am – 4 pm</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted)">Breakfast, lunch</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="micro">Night sitting</p>
        <p class="big">6 pm – 10:45 pm</p>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted)">Open every day</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

